WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.879 --> 00:00:05.005
You're my girl.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.340
I turned you in.

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:08.258
I'm pregnant.

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:10.052
So what comes next?

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.429
Nothing good.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.390
-What do you want?
-Oh, relax, sweetheart.

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:18.143
I just need you to call
your lady friends over

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.811
so we can all have...

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:22.064
a little talk.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.774
We take our kids
to PF Chang's,

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.944
and we take orange slices
to soccer games.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.448
And when bad things
happen to good people,

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.200
everyone else goes crazy.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.370
I keep thinking
about what you said,

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.331
about being a basic bitch,
and whatnot.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.208
That's not exactly
what I said--

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.125
Maybe there's something

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.211
you could help me out with.

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:48.382
You know the tradition

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.551
is Jordans
over a phone line, right?

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:53.262
I only had pumps.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.097
Fair enough.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.435
Okay, come on.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.230
You can do it. Get it.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.606
What do you want?

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.778
They're gonna wanna know
what someone like me

00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:11.154
is doing
with someone like you.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.158
What are you doing
with someone like me?

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.203
That family
you're always talking about?

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:20.122
Go home to them.

00:01:20.956 --> 00:01:22.499
What me and you had is done.

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:23.500
Over.

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:26.587
What are you doing,
Elizabeth?

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:32.426
I don't know.

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:36.138
I just want it to be over.

00:01:37.264 --> 00:01:38.307
Okay.

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:40.726
Let's end it.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.102
It's all right.

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:43.312
It's okay.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:49.276
You did your best.

00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:50.944
It turns out,

00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:52.946
we've got a mutual friend.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.907
Yeah, I'm gonna need you
to take care of him.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.283
That's insane!

00:01:57.409 --> 00:01:58.243
Is it?

00:01:58.327 --> 00:02:00.829
I can't just murder someone.
I'm not a psychopath.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.499
Not easy
being the boss, huh?

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.627
Excuse me, miss?

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.920
I just need…

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:10.589
service.

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:34.821
You can't tell people
you're my business partner.

00:02:34.905 --> 00:02:35.739
Well...

00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:37.783
what do you want
to call us, then?

00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:40.202
Let's just
not label it, okay?

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:41.995
You look good
behind that desk.

00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:44.957
Thank you.

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:48.710
You'd look
so much better on top of it.

00:03:03.517 --> 00:03:05.227
I'm gonna take a shower.
You should go.

00:03:07.896 --> 00:03:08.939
It's over.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.027
What are you doing here?

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.821
I tried calling.

00:03:16.488 --> 00:03:17.656
I blocked your number.

00:03:19.783 --> 00:03:21.201
Damn, that's cold.

00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:23.161
I'm about
to be arrested for murder.

00:03:25.956 --> 00:03:27.082
That sucks.

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:29.501
And you couldn't
return a text?

00:03:29.585 --> 00:03:32.004
Hey, I don't work
while on vacation.

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:33.714
That's what I am? Work?

00:03:33.797 --> 00:03:35.382
Pretty much, yeah.

00:03:35.465 --> 00:03:37.426
You put everything on me.

00:03:38.427 --> 00:03:39.428
The money,

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.013
the dealership--

00:03:41.096 --> 00:03:42.431
It's not easy
being king, right?

00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:44.933
You put it all on me,
so it's never on you.

00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:45.976
Nothing's ever on you.

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.312
Well, now you've got
a bigger problem, don't you?

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.358
You think he's my problem?

00:03:54.109 --> 00:03:55.569
So, put on
your big girl panties

00:03:55.652 --> 00:03:56.528
and take care of it.

00:03:56.612 --> 00:03:58.280
He's not my problem.

00:03:58.363 --> 00:04:00.908
Shut your mouth, bitch,
okay, and just handle it--

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:14.630
Lung.

00:04:19.134 --> 00:04:20.219
Spleen.

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.141
Shoulder.

00:04:27.392 --> 00:04:28.644
You're my girl,

00:04:29.186 --> 00:04:30.437
you know, so...

00:04:31.355 --> 00:04:32.689
I'm gonna
take it easy on you.

00:04:34.233 --> 00:04:35.359
I'll do it myself.

00:04:36.193 --> 00:04:37.486
I'm pregnant.

00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:43.450
Congratulations.

00:04:45.244 --> 00:04:46.370
Anything else?

00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:48.914
Paternity test.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.960
Thank you so much.

00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:55.003
Can I get a shot of tequila?

00:04:56.171 --> 00:04:58.090
You might wanna
slow down, yeah?

00:04:59.967 --> 00:05:01.385
We never got to toast.

00:05:03.178 --> 00:05:05.013
One for
my baby daddy here, too.

00:05:09.059 --> 00:05:10.269
I lost it.

00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:16.859
So, what comes next?

00:05:17.401 --> 00:05:18.735
Nothing good.

00:05:20.195 --> 00:05:21.238
They want you.

00:05:23.574 --> 00:05:25.492
Yeah, I figured
one of them was coming.

00:05:41.842 --> 00:05:42.968
So, dinner was...

00:05:45.554 --> 00:05:46.471
fun,

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:47.890
yeah?

00:05:50.934 --> 00:05:52.019
Parts of it.

00:05:52.769 --> 00:05:54.354
Please don't hurt my kids.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.274
I ain't gonna hurt nobody.

00:05:58.108 --> 00:05:59.985
But I turned you in.

00:06:00.944 --> 00:06:02.946
So, your tag
is really coming along.

00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:06.200
I've got
a really good campaign team.

00:06:08.785 --> 00:06:10.287
I told you
you didn't need him.

00:06:11.997 --> 00:06:13.123
If you need something,
darling,

00:06:13.207 --> 00:06:14.625
all you've got to do is ask.

00:06:17.419 --> 00:06:18.587
He's your brother.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.005
Cousin.

00:06:20.839 --> 00:06:21.715
Family.

00:06:25.135 --> 00:06:26.428
He's in our way.

00:06:27.971 --> 00:06:29.723
You know the best part
about all this?

00:06:34.102 --> 00:06:35.771
What? Not the city salary?

00:06:40.108 --> 00:06:41.485
You work for me now.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.664
You got it, boss.

